From 8f913c8626e2dbbdf435d594b98fdd9c2749d001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qwqgong-ui <248246420+qwqgong-ui@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 18:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] xhttp: add injectable browser transport

Allow AndroidCyaml to replace the standard XHTTP HTTP transport at runtime
without changing the user's proxy YAML. Browser mode preserves stream-up when
the embedding WebView supports streaming request bodies, while stream-one and
unsupported stream-up configurations fall back to packet-up. Cookie placements
and custom Cookie headers are rejected because browser JavaScript cannot set
them faithfully. The normal transport remains untouched when no factory is
installed.
